:: Shopping Day 1f [unfinished]

(metadata:
"currency", "rial",
"title", "The Vehzin Warehouse",
"cardDesc", "If the Grand Exchange is the heart, then vehzin is the blood. Crimson, powdery, raw - it is mined in great quantities in Central Askava before coming here and ultimately, to everywhere else in the world.",
"parent", "S: Shopping Day 1",
"devNote", [Need to implement the vehzin shortage.],
)

<!--Market setup-->
<!--item list-->
(set: _itemList to (a: "vehzin"))
<!--buy factor-->
(set: _buyFactors to (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalBuy)
<!--sell factor-->
(set: _sellFactors to ($funcMarketMergeFactors: _buyFactors, (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalSell))
<!--define base mods-->
(set: _baseBuyMod to 2.5)
(set: _baseSellMod to .8)
<!--end of market setup-->

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[

	(css: "font-size: 70%")[
        $cssColumnChild[(link: "⇦ Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]]
     ]

	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: Shopping Day 1")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[
All matter responds to magic to some extent, much in the same way a rock "repsonds" to a hammer - dumbly, and often with the former breaking. Except for vehzin; its value comes from how eagerly it bends to a magus's will. "Thought-metal". "//Wise//-metal".
<br>

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent-->

---

$cssColumnParent[
$cssColumnChild[
<!--Readout-->
$cssDesc[($funcMarketReadoutFull: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors)]
<!--end of readout-->
]<!--end child, begin another-->

$cssColumnChild[
<!--main buy/sell menu-->
<ol>
($funcMarketMain: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, (passage:)'s currency, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors, 1)
<br>
Or...
<br>
<li>(link: "Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]</li>
</ol>
<!--end of main buy/sell menu-->

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent 2-->

